{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-strategies","title":"测试策略：Widget Test、集成测试与 Golden Test","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/production/testing-strategies","wordCount":643,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试策略-widget-test-集成测试与-golden-test\">测试策略：Widget Test、集成测试与 Golden Test</h1><p>Flutter 提供了完整的测试金字塔支持，从快速的单元测试到覆盖整个应用流程的集成测试。良好的测试策略是保障代码质量、防止回归、支撑快速迭代的核心基础设施。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>单元测试（Unit Test）</strong></td>\n<td>测试单个函数、类或方法，不依赖 Flutter 框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Widget Test</strong></td>\n<td>测试 Widget 的渲染和交互，在模拟环境中运行（无需真机）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>集成测试（Integration Test）</strong></td>\n<td>在真机或模拟器上运行，测试完整应用流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Golden Test</strong></td>\n<td>通过像素级截图比对来检测 UI 变化的回归测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>WidgetTester</strong></td>\n<td>Widget Test 的核心工具，提供 pump、tap、find 等 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>testWidgets</strong></td>\n<td>Widget Test 的测试函数，提供 WidgetTester 实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Mocktail</strong></td>\n<td>Dart 的 Mock 库，基于 null safety 设计，替代 mockito</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>flutter_test</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 官方测试框架包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试金字塔\">测试金字塔</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;  subgraph Pyramid[&quot;Flutter 测试金字塔&quot;]&#10;    IT[&quot;集成测试\\nIntegration Test\\n少量 · 慢 · 真机&quot;]&#10;    GT[&quot;Golden Test\\nUI 截图比对\\n中量 · 较慢&quot;]&#10;    WT[&quot;Widget Test\\n组件行为测试\\n大量 · 快&quot;]&#10;    UT[&quot;单元测试\\nUnit Test\\n最多 · 最快&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  UT --&gt; WT --&gt; GT --&gt; IT\">graph TB\n  subgraph Pyramid[\"Flutter 测试金字塔\"]\n    IT[\"集成测试\\nIntegration Test\\n少量 · 慢 · 真机\"]\n    GT[\"Golden Test\\nUI 截图比对\\n中量 · 较慢\"]\n    WT[\"Widget Test\\n组件行为测试\\n大量 · 快\"]\n    UT[\"单元测试\\nUnit Test\\n最多 · 最快\"]\n  end\n  UT --&gt; WT --&gt; GT --&gt; IT</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>运行速度</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>推荐数量占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>极快（&lt; 1ms）</td>\n<td>单个函数/类</td>\n<td>~60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Widget Test</td>\n<td>快（&lt; 100ms）</td>\n<td>单个 Widget 组件</td>\n<td>~30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Golden Test</td>\n<td>较慢（需渲染）</td>\n<td>UI 外观</td>\n<td>~5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>慢（需真机）</td>\n<td>完整用户流程</td>\n<td>~5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"单元测试-测试业务逻辑\">单元测试：测试业务逻辑</h2><p>单元测试覆盖领域层（Entity、Use Case、Repository 逻辑）——这部分不依赖 Flutter 框架，测试最简单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// test/domain/usecases/get_current_user_test.dart&#10;import &#39;package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart&#39;;&#10;import &#39;package:mocktail/mocktail.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;class MockUserRepository extends Mock implements UserRepository {}&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;  late GetCurrentUser useCase;&#10;  late MockUserRepository mockRepo;&#10;&#10;  setUp(() {&#10;    mockRepo = MockUserRepository();&#10;    useCase = GetCurrentUser(mockRepo);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  group(&#39;GetCurrentUser&#39;, () {&#10;    const testUser = User(&#10;      id: &#39;1&#39;,&#10;      name: &#39;Alice&#39;,&#10;      email: &#39;alice@example.com&#39;,&#10;      role: UserRole.user,&#10;      createdAt: DateTime(2025),&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    test(&#39;should return User when repository call succeeds&#39;, () async {&#10;      // Arrange&#10;      when(() =&gt; mockRepo.getCurrentUser()).thenAnswer((_) async =&gt; testUser);&#10;&#10;      // Act&#10;      final result = await useCase();&#10;&#10;      // Assert&#10;      expect(result, equals(testUser));&#10;      verify(() =&gt; mockRepo.getCurrentUser()).called(1);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    test(&#39;should propagate exception when repository throws&#39;, () async {&#10;      // Arrange&#10;      when(() =&gt; mockRepo.getCurrentUser())&#10;          .thenThrow(const NetworkException(&#39;No connection&#39;));&#10;&#10;      // Act &amp; Assert&#10;      expect(useCase(), throwsA(isA&lt;NetworkException&gt;()));&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// test/domain/usecases/get_current_user_test.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:mocktail/mocktail.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MockUserRepository extends Mock implements UserRepository {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late GetCurrentUser useCase;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late MockUserRepository mockRepo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setUp(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mockRepo = MockUserRepository();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    useCase = GetCurrentUser(mockRepo);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group('GetCurrentUser', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const testUser = User(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      id: '1',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      name: 'Alice',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      email: 'alice@example.com',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      role: UserRole.user,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      createdAt: DateTime(2025),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    test('should return User when repository call succeeds', () async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // Arrange</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      when(() => mockRepo.getCurrentUser()).thenAnswer((_) async => testUser);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // Act</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final result = await useCase();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // Assert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(result, equals(testUser));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      verify(() => mockRepo.getCurrentUser()).called(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    test('should propagate exception when repository throws', () async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // Arrange</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      when(() => mockRepo.getCurrentUser())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          .thenThrow(const NetworkException('No connection'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // Act &#x26; Assert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(useCase(), throwsA(isA&#x3C;NetworkException>()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试-riverpod-provider\">测试 Riverpod Provider</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// test/presentation/providers/user_provider_test.dart&#10;void main() {&#10;  test(&#39;currentUserProvider emits user on success&#39;, () async {&#10;    final container = ProviderContainer(&#10;      overrides: [&#10;        // 注入 Mock 依赖&#10;        userRepositoryProvider.overrideWithValue(MockUserRepository()),&#10;      ],&#10;    );&#10;    addTearDown(container.dispose);&#10;&#10;    when(() =&gt; container.read(userRepositoryProvider).getCurrentUser())&#10;        .thenAnswer((_) async =&gt; testUser);&#10;&#10;    final result = await container.read(currentUserProvider.future);&#10;    expect(result, equals(testUser));&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// test/presentation/providers/user_provider_test.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  test('currentUserProvider emits user on success', () async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final container = ProviderContainer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      overrides: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 注入 Mock 依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        userRepositoryProvider.overrideWithValue(MockUserRepository()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addTearDown(container.dispose);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when(() => container.read(userRepositoryProvider).getCurrentUser())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .thenAnswer((_) async => testUser);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final result = await container.read(currentUserProvider.future);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(result, equals(testUser));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"widget-test-测试组件行为\">Widget Test：测试组件行为</h2><p>Widget Test 是 Flutter 测试金字塔中投入产出比最高的层级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// test/presentation/widgets/product_card_test.dart&#10;void main() {&#10;  group(&#39;ProductCard&#39;, () {&#10;    testWidgets(&#39;renders product name and price&#39;, (tester) async {&#10;      const product = Product(&#10;        id: &#39;1&#39;,&#10;        name: &#39;Flutter Cookbook&#39;,&#10;        price: 39.99,&#10;        imageUrl: &#39;https://example.com/book.jpg&#39;,&#10;      );&#10;&#10;      await tester.pumpWidget(&#10;        MaterialApp(&#10;          home: Scaffold(&#10;            body: ProductCard(product: product),&#10;          ),&#10;        ),&#10;      );&#10;&#10;      // 查找 Widget&#10;      expect(find.text(&#39;Flutter Cookbook&#39;), findsOneWidget);&#10;      expect(find.text(&#39;\\$39.99&#39;), findsOneWidget);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    testWidgets(&#39;calls onAddToCart when button tapped&#39;, (tester) async {&#10;      bool addToCartCalled = false;&#10;&#10;      await tester.pumpWidget(&#10;        MaterialApp(&#10;          home: Scaffold(&#10;            body: ProductCard(&#10;              product: testProduct,&#10;              onAddToCart: () =&gt; addToCartCalled = true,&#10;            ),&#10;          ),&#10;        ),&#10;      );&#10;&#10;      await tester.tap(find.byIcon(Icons.add_shopping_cart));&#10;      await tester.pump();&#10;&#10;      expect(addToCartCalled, isTrue);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    testWidgets(&#39;shows loading indicator while image loads&#39;, (tester) async {&#10;      await tester.pumpWidget(&#10;        MaterialApp(&#10;          home: Scaffold(&#10;            body: ProductCard(product: testProductWithNetworkImage),&#10;          ),&#10;        ),&#10;      );&#10;&#10;      // pump() 触发一帧，不等待异步完成&#10;      await tester.pump();&#10;      expect(find.byType(CircularProgressIndicator), findsOneWidget);&#10;&#10;      // pumpAndSettle() 等待所有动画和异步完成&#10;      await tester.pumpAndSettle();&#10;      expect(find.byType(CircularProgressIndicator), findsNothing);&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// test/presentation/widgets/product_card_test.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group('ProductCard', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testWidgets('renders product name and price', (tester) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const product = Product(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        id: '1',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        name: 'Flutter Cookbook',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        price: 39.99,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        imageUrl: 'https://example.com/book.jpg',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await tester.pumpWidget(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        MaterialApp(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          home: Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            body: ProductCard(product: product),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 查找 Widget</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(find.text('Flutter Cookbook'), findsOneWidget);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(find.text('\\$39.99'), findsOneWidget);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testWidgets('calls onAddToCart when button tapped', (tester) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      bool addToCartCalled = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await tester.pumpWidget(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        MaterialApp(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          home: Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            body: ProductCard(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              product: testProduct,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              onAddToCart: () => addToCartCalled = true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await tester.tap(find.byIcon(Icons.add_shopping_cart));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await tester.pump();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(addToCartCalled, isTrue);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testWidgets('shows loading indicator while image loads', (tester) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await tester.pumpWidget(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        MaterialApp(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          home: Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            body: ProductCard(product: testProductWithNetworkImage),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // pump() 触发一帧，不等待异步完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await tester.pump();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(find.byType(CircularProgressIndicator), findsOneWidget);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // pumpAndSettle() 等待所有动画和异步完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await tester.pumpAndSettle();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(find.byType(CircularProgressIndicator), findsNothing);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试-riverpod-状态\">测试 Riverpod 状态</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"testWidgets(&#39;CartPage shows items from Riverpod provider&#39;, (tester) async {&#10;  final container = ProviderContainer(&#10;    overrides: [&#10;      cartNotifierProvider.overrideWith(() =&gt; FakeCartNotifier()),&#10;    ],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  await tester.pumpWidget(&#10;    UncontrolledProviderScope(&#10;      container: container,&#10;      child: const MaterialApp(home: CartPage()),&#10;    ),&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  await tester.pumpAndSettle();&#10;  expect(find.text(&#39;Test Product&#39;), findsOneWidget);&#10;});&#10;&#10;class FakeCartNotifier extends CartNotifier {&#10;  @override&#10;  List&lt;CartItem&gt; build() =&gt; [&#10;    CartItem(id: &#39;1&#39;, name: &#39;Test Product&#39;, price: 9.99),&#10;  ];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>testWidgets('CartPage shows items from Riverpod provider', (tester) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final container = ProviderContainer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    overrides: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      cartNotifierProvider.overrideWith(() => FakeCartNotifier()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await tester.pumpWidget(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    UncontrolledProviderScope(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      container: container,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      child: const MaterialApp(home: CartPage()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await tester.pumpAndSettle();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(find.text('Test Product'), findsOneWidget);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class FakeCartNotifier extends CartNotifier {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  List&#x3C;CartItem> build() => [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    CartItem(id: '1', name: 'Test Product', price: 9.99),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"golden-test-像素级-ui-回归测试\">Golden Test：像素级 UI 回归测试</h2><p>Golden Test 将 Widget 渲染为图像并与「黄金标准」截图比对，防止意外的 UI 变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// test/presentation/widgets/product_card_golden_test.dart&#10;void main() {&#10;  testWidgets(&#39;ProductCard golden test&#39;, (tester) async {&#10;    await tester.pumpWidget(&#10;      MaterialApp(&#10;        theme: AppTheme.light,&#10;        home: Scaffold(&#10;          body: Center(&#10;            child: SizedBox(&#10;              width: 300,&#10;              child: ProductCard(product: testProduct),&#10;            ),&#10;          ),&#10;        ),&#10;      ),&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    await expectLater(&#10;      find.byType(ProductCard),&#10;      matchesGoldenFile(&#39;goldens/product_card.png&#39;),&#10;    );&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// test/presentation/widgets/product_card_golden_test.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  testWidgets('ProductCard golden test', (tester) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await tester.pumpWidget(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      MaterialApp(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        theme: AppTheme.light,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        home: Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          body: Center(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            child: SizedBox(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              width: 300,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              child: ProductCard(product: testProduct),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await expectLater(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      find.byType(ProductCard),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      matchesGoldenFile('goldens/product_card.png'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>更新黄金文件</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 首次生成或需要更新时&#10;flutter test --update-goldens test/presentation/widgets/product_card_golden_test.dart\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 首次生成或需要更新时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flutter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --update-goldens</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test/presentation/widgets/product_card_golden_test.dart</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-golden_toolkit-提升-golden-test-能力\">使用 golden_toolkit 提升 Golden Test 能力</h3><p><code>golden_toolkit</code> 提供多屏幕尺寸、暗色/亮色主题的批量截图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"void main() {&#10;  testGoldens(&#39;ProductCard in multiple sizes&#39;, (tester) async {&#10;    await tester.pumpWidgetBuilder(&#10;      ProductCard(product: testProduct),&#10;      wrapper: materialAppWrapper(theme: ThemeData.light()),&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    await multiScreenGolden(tester, &#39;product_card&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  testGoldens('ProductCard in multiple sizes', (tester) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await tester.pumpWidgetBuilder(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ProductCard(product: testProduct),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      wrapper: materialAppWrapper(theme: ThemeData.light()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await multiScreenGolden(tester, 'product_card');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试-端到端流程验证\">集成测试：端到端流程验证</h2><p>集成测试在真机或模拟器上运行，验证完整用户流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// integration_test/login_flow_test.dart&#10;import &#39;package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart&#39;;&#10;import &#39;package:integration_test/integration_test.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;  IntegrationTestWidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();&#10;&#10;  testWidgets(&#39;Complete login flow&#39;, (tester) async {&#10;    app.main(); // 启动真实应用&#10;    await tester.pumpAndSettle();&#10;&#10;    // 导航到登录页&#10;    expect(find.byType(LoginPage), findsOneWidget);&#10;&#10;    // 输入凭证&#10;    await tester.enterText(find.byKey(const Key(&#39;email_field&#39;)), &#39;user@test.com&#39;);&#10;    await tester.enterText(find.byKey(const Key(&#39;password_field&#39;)), &#39;password123&#39;);&#10;&#10;    // 点击登录&#10;    await tester.tap(find.byKey(const Key(&#39;login_button&#39;)));&#10;    await tester.pumpAndSettle(const Duration(seconds: 5));&#10;&#10;    // 验证导航到主页&#10;    expect(find.byType(HomePage), findsOneWidget);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// integration_test/login_flow_test.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:integration_test/integration_test.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  IntegrationTestWidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  testWidgets('Complete login flow', (tester) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    app.main(); // 启动真实应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await tester.pumpAndSettle();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 导航到登录页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(find.byType(LoginPage), findsOneWidget);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 输入凭证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await tester.enterText(find.byKey(const Key('email_field')), 'user@test.com');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await tester.enterText(find.byKey(const Key('password_field')), 'password123');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 点击登录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await tester.tap(find.byKey(const Key('login_button')));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await tester.pumpAndSettle(const Duration(seconds: 5));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 验证导航到主页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(find.byType(HomePage), findsOneWidget);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>运行集成测试</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在连接的设备上运行&#10;flutter test integration_test/login_flow_test.dart&#10;&#10;# 在 Firebase Test Lab 上运行&#10;gcloud firebase test android run \\&#10;  --type instrumentation \\&#10;  --app build/app/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk \\&#10;  --test build/app/outputs/apk/androidTest/debug/app-debug-androidTest.apk\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在连接的设备上运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flutter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> integration_test/login_flow_test.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 Firebase Test Lab 上运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gcloud</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> firebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> android</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> instrumentation</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build/app/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build/app/outputs/apk/androidTest/debug/app-debug-androidTest.apk</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试覆盖率统计\">测试覆盖率统计</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成覆盖率报告&#10;flutter test --coverage&#10;&#10;# 生成 HTML 报告（需要 lcov）&#10;genhtml coverage/lcov.info -o coverage/html&#10;open coverage/html/index.html\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成覆盖率报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flutter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成 HTML 报告（需要 lcov）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">genhtml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> coverage/lcov.info</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> coverage/html</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> coverage/html/index.html</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Flutter 的测试策略遵循经典测试金字塔：<strong>大量单元测试</strong>（纯 Dart，测业务逻辑）+ <strong>中量 Widget Test</strong>（投入产出比最高，测组件行为）+ <strong>少量 Golden Test</strong>（防 UI 回归）+ <strong>极少集成测试</strong>（端到端流程，成本高但置信度高）。<code>Mocktail</code> 是 Dart null safety 时代的标准 Mock 库，<code>ProviderContainer</code> 是 Riverpod 测试的核心工具。Golden Test 要纳入 CI，防止 PR 意外改变 UI 外观。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../architecture/clean-architecture-flutter\">Clean Architecture 实践</a> — 分层架构使各层测试更独立</li>\n<li><a href=\"../architecture/state-management-patterns\">状态管理模式对比</a> — 各状态管理方案的测试方法</li>\n<li><a href=\"cicd-distribution\">CI/CD 与分发</a> — 测试如何集成到自动化 CI 流水线</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试策略：Widget Test、集成测试与 Golden Test","id":"测试策略-widget-test-集成测试与-golden-test"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测试金字塔","id":"测试金字塔"},{"level":2,"text":"单元测试：测试业务逻辑","id":"单元测试-测试业务逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"测试 Riverpod Provider","id":"测试-riverpod-provider"},{"level":2,"text":"Widget Test：测试组件行为","id":"widget-test-测试组件行为"},{"level":3,"text":"测试 Riverpod 状态","id":"测试-riverpod-状态"},{"level":2,"text":"Golden Test：像素级 UI 回归测试","id":"golden-test-像素级-ui-回归测试"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 golden_toolkit 提升 Golden Test 能力","id":"使用-golden_toolkit-提升-golden-test-能力"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试：端到端流程验证","id":"集成测试-端到端流程验证"},{"level":2,"text":"测试覆盖率统计","id":"测试覆盖率统计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"性能分析与优化：DevTools、Impeller 与 Jank 诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/production/performance-profiling"},"next":{"title":"CI/CD 与分发：Fastlane、Codemagic 与 Shorebird","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/production/cicd-distribution"}}